to Otama or so help me!

264
00:21:13,860 --> 00:21:15,497
I'll take good care of her.

265
00:21:15,580 --> 00:21:18,100
You better return the blade as well!

266
00:21:18,760 --> 00:21:20,080
Are you listening?

267
00:21:21,620 --> 00:21:23,760
He isn't listening.

268
00:21:36,300 --> 00:21:37,997
It's the giant puppy.

269
00:21:38,080 --> 00:21:39,820
Can we hitch a ride on you?

270
00:21:47,720 --> 00:21:49,020
Heck yeah Yeah!

271
00:21:49,300 --> 00:21:51,180
Spine taking us to town, pal?

272
00:22:02,020 --> 00:22:03,060
Hey, Tama!

273
00:22:03,280 --> 00:22:05,180
Finally awake? Big bro!

274
00:22:05,580 --> 00:22:07,460
Where's Komachiyo taking us?

275
00:22:08,380 --> 00:22:09,210
To the doctor!

276
00:22:09,293 --> 00:22:11,591
Do you think your dog knows the way there?

277
00:22:17,980 --> 00:22:19,500
But Ace is dead now.

278
00:22:31,100 --> 00:22:31,930
Whoa, whoa!

279
00:22:32,013 --> 00:22:34,412
Knock it off, Tama, or you're gonna fall!

280
00:22:35,540 --> 00:22:36,370
Yeah!

281
00:22:36,453 --> 00:22:38,340
You're a big old liar!

282
00:22:43,460 --> 00:22:45,840
I'm sorry, but Ace is gone.

283
00:22:46,760 --> 00:22:47,900
Ask anyone.

284
00:22:48,220 --> 00:22:50,573
We all know what happened in Marineford.

285
00:23:01,000 --> 00:23:02,580
It can't be!

286
00:23:03,960 --> 00:23:08,280
We made a promise, and I know
Ace wouldn't break his life.

287
00:23:16,720 --> 00:23:19,420
Ace, take me with you on your ship.

288
00:23:21,680 --> 00:23:23,360
I'm big enough to go.

289
00:23:26,340 --> 00:23:28,700
But you're only five. Sorry, kid.

290
00:23:29,500 --> 00:23:31,540
So, I'll be six next year.

291
00:23:31,820 --> 00:23:33,197
You're getting good at that.

292
00:23:33,280 --> 00:23:34,260
Of course I am.

293
00:23:34,880 --> 00:23:38,060
You're going to leave
soon, aren't you? Uh-huh.

294
00:23:38,280 --> 00:23:40,692
I got a few things to take care of, okay?

295
00:23:43,620 --> 00:23:45,460
I don't want you to go.

296
00:23:45,780 --> 00:23:47,740
I want you guys all to stay.

297
00:23:50,420 --> 00:23:51,250
Tama.

298
00:23:53,660 --> 00:23:55,557
I won't keep you waiting too long.

299
00:23:55,640 --> 00:23:58,522
We'll come back soon and
with a much bigger crew.

300
00:23:59,200 --> 00:24:03,220
Then if I wait, can I join
you after you come back?

301
00:24:04,420 --> 00:24:07,780
I want to sail and go on
an adventure with you guys.

302
00:24:10,180 --> 00:24:12,380
Look, a pirate's got to be strong.

303
00:24:13,380 --> 00:24:14,757
But I'll tell you what?

304
00:24:14,840 --> 00:24:19,760
When I come back, if you become a
bewitching ninja, I promise to take you.

305
00:24:21,760 --> 00:24:23,117
Now that's cute!

306
00:24:23,200 --> 00:24:24,980
Funny choice of words, though?

307
00:24:29,020 --> 00:24:30,220
Okay, then!

308
00:24:30,700 --> 00:24:32,640
Do you really promise?

309
00:24:33,080 --> 00:24:34,840
No taxis-paxis, okay?

310
00:24:42,240 --> 00:24:43,070
Please.

311
00:24:43,780 --> 00:24:45,660
He was so kind to me.

312
00:24:46,280 --> 00:24:47,800
It's not fair.

313
00:24:48,160 --> 00:24:50,320
I waited so long for him.

314
00:24:50,940 --> 00:24:52,877
Oh, he was so nice!

315
00:24:52,960 --> 00:24:55,195
You don't know how much you've missed!

316
00:24:55,320 --> 00:24:58,140
You will never understand my fate!

317
00:24:58,820 --> 00:24:59,840
And it hurts!

318
00:25:00,120 --> 00:25:01,260
Quit hitting me!

319
00:25:02,320 --> 00:25:03,740
You're a big Fight!

320
00:25:03,900 --> 00:25:05,194
You don't care at all!

321
00:25:08,600 --> 00:25:10,180
You're no big pro!

322
00:25:10,460 --> 00:25:11,980
You're just a chick!

323
00:25:19,360 --> 00:25:21,066
That's the end of the forest!

324
00:25:32,660 --> 00:25:34,580
Grimpa knows what's right.

325
00:25:35,000 --> 00:25:36,340
It's not a joke.

326
00:25:36,780 --> 00:25:38,800
It really is a wasteland.

327
00:25:48,440 --> 00:25:49,960
A tiger!

328
00:25:52,360 --> 00:25:53,980
And the big boar, too!

329
00:25:57,960 --> 00:25:59,180
What's that thing?

330
00:25:59,480 --> 00:26:01,320
Oh, that's a shark-o-dial!

331
00:26:01,460 --> 00:26:02,980
This place is wild!

332
00:26:05,600 --> 00:26:08,660
Just eat those guys, then
you won't be so hungry!

333
00:26:08,800 --> 00:26:09,918
It's not that easy.

334
00:26:10,460 --> 00:26:12,637
All the samurai who
were powerful enough to

335
00:26:12,720 --> 00:26:15,057
take them down were either
caught by the police.

336
00:26:15,140 --> 00:26:17,540
or they turned into bandits to survive.

337
00:26:19,340 --> 00:26:20,170
Besides...

338
00:26:24,200 --> 00:26:27,200
Animals around here drink
the polluted river water.

339
00:26:27,480 --> 00:26:31,068
Because of that, they become
way too poisonous for us to eat.

340
00:26:32,380 --> 00:26:34,780
But they look so meaty and tasty!

341
00:26:35,780 --> 00:26:36,980
It's unforgivable!

342
00:26:37,820 --> 00:26:40,232
Is that the factory making all the smoke?

343
00:26:40,900 --> 00:26:42,200
Yeah, that's right!

344
00:26:42,860 --> 00:26:45,537
They make weapons and
they have a mine there!

345
00:26:45,620 --> 00:26:46,940
And that's not all!

346
00:26:47,100 --> 00:26:50,340
That place is full of bad
guys that work! Kaido!

347
00:26:52,680 --> 00:26:54,860
Well, what do they eat then?

348
00:26:56,200 --> 00:26:58,680
The Shogun and Kaido have a farm.

349
00:26:59,100 --> 00:27:00,820
No one else can use it.

350
00:27:01,200 --> 00:27:03,300
It makes food just for them.

351
00:27:07,180 --> 00:27:13,460
They have clean water, and rice
fields, and veggies, and fish too.

352
00:27:15,780 --> 00:27:17,380
Plus a lot of food.

353
00:27:19,520 --> 00:27:20,640
I gotcha.

354
00:27:20,800 --> 00:27:22,741
So they do have food around here.

355
00:27:25,480 --> 00:27:26,697
Tama, you okay?

356
00:27:26,780 --> 00:27:27,740
Talk to me!

357
00:27:28,280 --> 00:27:29,110
Oh, no.

358
00:27:29,340 --> 00:27:31,693
I think your fever's getting even worse.

359
00:27:34,760 --> 00:27:36,200
Just hang on, okay?

360
00:27:37,920 --> 00:27:39,600
I'll get you to a doctor.

361
00:27:41,940 --> 00:27:45,940
If those jerks have enough food and
water, then I'll make this work.

362
00:27:46,280 --> 00:27:47,680
Hurry it up, dog!

363
00:27:54,580 --> 00:27:56,940
Please show mercy on me!

364
00:28:00,300 --> 00:28:02,260
You can't outrun us.

365
00:28:02,520 --> 00:28:04,461
Drop everything you've got, lady.

366
00:28:04,980 --> 00:28:06,080
I beg of you!

367
00:28:06,460 --> 00:28:07,680
Someone help!

368
00:28:25,640 --> 00:28:32,100
you bastard i'll make you pay
stay back i'll handle this

369
00:28:40,000 --> 00:28:41,840
I know that face.

370
00:28:42,120 --> 00:28:43,420
This is Orochillo.

371
00:28:44,480 --> 00:28:46,160
What you got there?

372
00:28:46,600 --> 00:28:48,000
Looks like sake.

373
00:28:49,560 --> 00:28:50,620
Give it here!

374
00:29:31,420 --> 00:29:34,380
My lord, Samurai! Yeah.

375
00:29:35,040 --> 00:29:35,870
Huh?

376
00:29:39,400 --> 00:29:40,340
Good, sir.

377
00:29:40,620 --> 00:29:43,080
Whoever you are, thank you for saving me.

378
00:29:43,500 --> 00:29:45,020
I owe you my life.

379
00:29:50,000 --> 00:29:50,830
Woo!

380
00:29:50,913 --> 00:29:52,280
Stand up. No big deal.

381
00:29:52,680 --> 00:29:55,580
I was just after that
bozo's jug of sake anyway.

382
00:29:56,740 --> 00:29:58,700
I mean, honorably speaking.

383
00:29:58,860 --> 00:30:00,919
But surely I can repay you somehow.

384
00:30:02,580 --> 00:30:03,410
Hmm.

385
00:30:03,493 --> 00:30:04,323
More sake!

386
00:30:04,406 --> 00:30:07,020
I don't have any on my person.

387
00:30:19,120 --> 00:30:20,040
Zoro!

388
00:30:22,740 --> 00:30:24,997
Hey, Zoro! It's me!

389
00:30:25,080 --> 00:30:26,240
Over here!

390
00:30:29,200 --> 00:30:30,720
Luffy, yeah!

391
00:30:31,180 --> 00:30:32,620
You finally made it!

392
00:30:34,180 --> 00:30:35,940
It's real good to see you!

393
00:30:43,920 --> 00:30:45,240
It's been a while!

394
00:30:47,300 --> 00:30:50,280
It's been a long time,
most honorable Zoro!

395
00:30:55,980 --> 00:30:57,600
Is everyone with you?

396
00:30:58,360 --> 00:30:59,960
Yeah, but we got split up.

397
00:31:01,420 --> 00:31:02,380
They're okay.

398
00:31:09,880 --> 00:31:11,820
Whoa, I smell meat!

399
00:31:12,020 --> 00:31:12,961
Give me a snack!

400
00:31:13,440 --> 00:31:17,257
There are so many fish and animals around
here, you would not believe it, Luffy.

401
00:31:17,340 --> 00:31:18,170
Here you go.

402
00:31:19,540 --> 00:31:21,760
This area has so much to hunt.

403
00:31:22,040 --> 00:31:23,500
No, be careful.

404
00:31:23,840 --> 00:31:27,546
The water in this place is
poisonous and the wildlife drink it.

405
00:31:27,640 --> 00:31:31,169
So if you got this off an animal
here, then it's poison too.

406
00:31:31,700 --> 00:31:32,530
Checks out.

407
00:31:32,740 --> 00:31:34,740
Guess that's why my stomach hurts.

408
00:31:43,340 --> 00:31:46,105
Anyway, Zoro, we should
probably get going now!

409
00:31:46,600 --> 00:31:48,177
I ran into this little girl.

410
00:31:48,260 --> 00:31:49,377
One thing led to another.

411
00:31:49,460 --> 00:31:51,277
And now I need to take her to a doctor.

412
00:31:51,360 --> 00:31:52,713
She's not feeling good.

413
00:31:53,540 --> 00:31:54,370
Oh, yeah.

414
00:31:54,453 --> 00:31:55,869
The brat's in rough shape.

415
00:31:57,120 --> 00:31:59,649
Why the heck are you
stopping to eat, then?

416
00:32:00,120 --> 00:32:01,340
It'll be okay.

417
00:32:01,700 --> 00:32:02,994
I'll be done in a sec.

418
00:32:08,340 --> 00:32:11,320
Just choke it down already. I'm crying.

419
00:32:20,940 --> 00:32:22,120
Hello, gentlemen.

420
00:32:24,840 --> 00:32:29,140
How fortunate that I found the
fugitive Ronin himself, Zoro Giri.

421
00:32:29,800 --> 00:32:31,577
and he brought companions

422
00:32:31,660 --> 00:32:38,417
wait a

423
00:32:38,500 --> 00:32:39,330
minute

424
00:32:39,413 --> 00:32:42,817
we know him yeah be careful seems like.

425
00:32:42,900 --> 00:32:48,737
he's working for Kaido Straw Hat is here.

426
00:32:48,820 --> 00:32:53,737
I was just on my way to Kuri Beach I.

427
00:32:53,820 --> 00:32:57,232
I presume you're the culprit
behind the shoreline assault.

428
00:32:58,520 --> 00:33:02,300
I was told I lost two
subordinates in one baboon.

429
00:33:08,120 --> 00:33:12,720
The likelihood that you were
behind the attack is 98%.

430
00:33:15,620 --> 00:33:18,240
However, that does not matter now.

431
00:33:20,360 --> 00:33:23,560
In the land of Wano, you
must choose your path.

432
00:33:24,340 --> 00:33:26,840
Follow the strong, or become their prey.

433
00:33:33,720 --> 00:33:36,820
I think we're about to piss
Kin'emon off, huh, Luffy?

434
00:33:37,720 --> 00:33:39,740
He warned us not to make a scene.

435
00:33:47,700 --> 00:33:49,960
Uh-huh, well, too bad.

436
00:33:50,780 --> 00:33:52,520
I'll apologize later.
